            </note>
            <note corresp="#d282-f2" n="1" xml:id="d282-f2-content">
                <p>The letter was approved by Rusk and sent in telegram 121 to Djakarta, July 30,
                    9:17 p.m. (Ibid., Countries Series, West New Guinea, General, 7/27/62–7/31
                    /62)</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
